    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b5391bd1ef2b1676236a1ea",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然赢得了“天皇赏（春）”，下一步当然就是\n连续称霸春秋两季的天皇赏。不仅如此──",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1787cc141469f0dbb1d83c472399a4b01ba2a55e5d7402962965c7788bd824e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
