    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0213e428cb1dc3f3905efe3b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "跑得快的选手多如过江之鲫。\n然而如今有位足以颠覆至今所有常识的\n赛马娘突然现身，来势汹汹有如彗星。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1682f9bd348dd6855e7aca67d7f1c5c78050bff26222a8dbbe7327cf7fd084fb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
